#: ../../source/ARISE/ARISE.md:25
msgid "ARISE facilities and modules:"
msgstr "Instalaciones y módulos de ARISE:"

#: ../../source/ARISE/ARISE.md:9
msgid "ARISE"
msgstr "ARISE"

#: ../../source/ARISE/ARISE.md:10
msgid ""
"**A**gile, human-centric, and **R**eal-t**I**me enabled open "
"**S**ourc**E** technologies advancing industrial HRI in Europe"
msgstr ""
"**A**gile, human-centric, and **R**eal-t**I**me enabled open "
"**S**ourc**E** technologies advancing industrial HRI in Europe"

#: ../../source/ARISE/ARISE.md:12
msgid "**What is ARISE?**"
msgstr "**¿Qué es ARISE?**"

#: ../../source/ARISE/ARISE.md:14
msgid ""
"ARISE aims towards making industrial HRI more accessible and cost-"
"effective, in particular in healthcare, intra-logistics and manufacturing"
" sectors."
msgstr ""
"ARISE tiene como objetivo hacer que la interacción persona-robot (HRI) "
"industrial sea más accesible y rentable, especialmente en los sectores "
"sanitario, intralogístico y de manufactura."

#: ../../source/ARISE/ARISE.md:16
msgid "Mireya de Diego (Project Coordinator)"
msgstr "Mireya de Diego (Coordinadora del proyecto)"

#: ../../source/ARISE/ARISE.md:19
msgid ""
"“We want to develop a new open middleware that helps European companies "
"to generate robotic applications in an agile and robust way respecting "
"ethical and security standards to contribute to competitiveness of "
"European companies.”"
msgstr ""
"«Queremos desarrollar un nuevo middleware abierto que ayude a las "
"empresas europeas a generar aplicaciones robóticas de forma ágil y "
"robusta, respetando las normas éticas y de seguridad, para contribuir a "
"su competitividad»."

#: ../../source/ARISE/ARISE.md:22
msgid ""
"In this page you will have access to the description of our Testing and "
"Exèrimental Facility (aka TEF), and all our released reusable ROS2 "
"modules. These modules hope to present an integration between [FIWARE "
"Orion Context Broker](https://fiware-orion.readthedocs.io/en/master/) and"
" [eProsima Vulcanexus](https://vulcanexus.org/) to enable context-aware "
"robotic and industrial applications, alongside "
"[ROS4HRI](https://ros4hri.github.io/) as an open-source ROS standard and "
"a set of ROS packages to facilitate the development of Human-Robot "
"Interaction (HRI) capabilities on robots."
msgstr ""
"En esta página encontrará la descripción de nuestras instalaciones de "
"ensayo y experimentación (TEF, por sus siglas en inglés) y todos los "
"módulos reutilizables de ROS2 que hemos publicado. Estos módulos tienen "
"como objetivo integrar [FIWARE Orion Context Broker](https://fiware-"
"orion.readthedocs.io/en/master/) y [eProsima "
"Vulcanexus](https://vulcanexus.org/) para permitir el desarrollo de "
"aplicaciones robóticas e industriales sensibles al contexto, junto con "
"[ROS4HRI](https://ros4hri.github.io/), un estándar abierto de ROS y un "
"conjunto de paquetes de ROS que facilitan el desarrollo de capacidades de"
" interacción persona-robot (HRI)."

